/Title (Python has no enforced constant type; UPPER_CASE is a convention that tells programmers not to reassign these names. Variables use descriptive snake_case. Python is dynamically typed: x=10 followed by x='ten' is allowed, and x becomes a str. Multiple assignment swaps values without a temporary variable: a,b=b,a.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 608 0 R
/Prev 705 0 R
/Next 671 0 R
>>
endobj
707 0 obj
<<
/Title (Parentheses make the step calculation explicit; multiplication is evaluated before addition. ** binds more tightly than unary minus: -2**2 is -4, while \(-2\)**2 is 4. Expressions can show surprises:)
