/Title (Alternative external rate card: Read JSON at startup, validate required keys and types, and use the values in calculations. Startup parsing is O\(r\) for r small rate fields and uses O\(r\) memory. It permits rate changes without editing/rebuilding code but requires controlled versioning and validation; a module is simpler for a small fixed card.)
