/Title (Alternative rate cache: Compute each fat/SNF rate once and store it in a dictionary keyed by the pair. Lookup is average O\(1\) per entry versus a few O\(1\) arithmetic operations; total remains O\(n\). Extra space is O\(k\) for k unique pairs. Cache helps only when many entries reuse the same pair.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 710 0 R
/Prev 728 0 R
>>
